                  {
                    "value": "Monthly periodic retention - first observed delivered-purchase cohort M0 = 100%. Zero = an observed month with no repeat purchase; blank = not yet observable. M0 is neutral. M1+ teal bands: >0 to <0.5%, 0.5 to <1%, 1 to <2%, >=2%; zero is white.",
