                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Default cohorts: Jan 2017 to May 2018. Rates are customer-weighted, not lifetime retention. First observed purchase may not be true acquisition. Cutoff does not prove data completeness.",
